E543                             ; =============================================================================
E543                             ;  Checked build: the error report
E543                             ; =============================================================================
E543                             ; error: the report, then EXIT. A = the letter, PLACE = the place, X = the
E543                             ; data stack to show, RSV = S for the Rtn line. Nothing here relies on S: an
E543                             ; overflowed or underflowed hardware stack wraps inside its page, and only
E543                             ; its depth is shown.
E543                             ;   CR LF
E543                             ;   Err X @ line,col CR LF
E543                             ;   up to 16 characters from the place, raw, up to a CR, LF or NUL  CR LF
E543                             ;   Stk n: [...] and the top 8 cells at most, bottom to top  CR LF
E543                             ;   Rtn n CR LF
E543                             ; The numbers go through "#" (prnum), which pushes them over the data stack
E543                             ; and pops them again, so the stack is shown as it was. With the stack full
E543                             ; (X = 0Eh) that reaches down to 0Ah, so nothing the report keeps is there.
E543   48           ERROR:    PHA      ; the letter
E544   AD 36 04               LDA   PLACE   
E547   85 02                  STA   P   
E549   AD 37 04               LDA   PLACE+1   
E54C   85 03                  STA   P+1   
